.TH "GH-EXTENSION-UPGRADE" "1" "Mar 2026" "GitHub CLI 2.89.0" "GitHub CLI manual"

.SH NAME
gh-extension-upgrade - Upgrade installed extensions


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgh extension upgrade {<name> | --all} [flags]\fR


.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB--all\fR
Upgrade all extensions

.TP
\fB--dry-run\fR
Only display upgrades

.TP
\fB--force\fR
Force upgrade extension


.SH EXIT CODES
0: Successful execution

.PP
1: Error

.PP
2: Command canceled

.PP
4: Authentication required

.PP
NOTE: Specific commands may have additional exit codes. Refer to the command's help for more information.


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgh-extension(1)\fR
